        "jp": "すぐに圧政も終わるはずです。\r\nそれまでがうちの稼ぎ時なんで\r\nじゃんじゃんご利用くださいね。",
        "official_en": "The regime’s coming to an end. I’m going to keep my shop open as long as I can...so buy something, will ya?",
        "real_en": "This oppressive rule should be ending soon. Until then, this is when my shop makes its money, so buy as much as you like!"
